OL,3,GNEWSAPupils behind AI war film to lay
OL,4,Awreath at Cenotaph
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of schoolchildren given
OL,7,Fnational recognition for bringing
OL,8,Fhistory to life through AI are to join
OL,9,Fthe national Armistice commemoration in
OL,10,FLondon.
OL,12,FPupils from Penair School in Truro have
OL,13,Fbeen invited to lay a wreath at the
OL,14,FCenotaph, Whitehall, after their work
OL,15,Fexamining the lives of Cornish miners
OL,16,Frecruited to tunnel under enemy lines
OL,17,Fduring World War One.
OL,19,FThe students spent 400 hours examining
OL,20,Fwartime diaries and census data, before
OL,21,Fcreating a film with images generated
OL,22,Fthrough AI.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
