OL,3,GNEWSAPupils behind AI war film to lay
OL,4,Awreath at Cenotaph
OL,5,
OL,6,FErin, 14, said it was amazing to talk
OL,7,Fabout the role Cornish people played
OL,8,Fduring World War One, adding: "It's
OL,9,Freally important to remember all the
OL,10,Fthings that these people have done."
